31,1,1,talk,Rin,,Everyone! I know something! Asuka is the werewolf!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That was fast. @Rin, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"A bold claim right at the start. @Rin, are you sure about this?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,That is an absurd accusation. I am a human. Rin is lying to confuse us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,Interesting. A Seer claim on turn one. Let's see how Asuka handles the pressure.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Yes, I'm the Seer! I checked Asuka and she's the bad one!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Rin is the Seer, the werewolf is found. But if Rin is the werewolf, she's framing Asuka.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Asuka, your reaction was calm, but that doesn't prove innocence. However, Rin is very young.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Age is irrelevant to logic. Rin is either a very clumsy werewolf or the Possessed trying to protect the wolf.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, why are you hesitating? The evidence is presented. Either Rin is the Seer or she's a liar.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not lying! I really saw it! Please believe me!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, @Shion, what do you think? If we execute Asuka and she's human, we lose a villager.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I trust Rin's energy, but we must be careful. Still, a Seer's lead is usually the strongest.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,This is a reckless gamble. You are blindly following a child's claim without any verification.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"The risk is calculated. If Rin is the Seer, the game ends now. I'm leaning towards Rin.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Rin,,See! Shion believes me! Let's vote for Asuka!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll trust the Seer's divination for now. It's the most direct path to victory.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let's go with Rin's result.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Asuka,,You are all making a grave mistake.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"A mistake for you, perhaps. I'll vote for Asuka.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
